data: {"type":"stage","stage":{"kind":"lead","title":"What Sisu noticed","summary":"53 purchases under €10 added up to €173 this year","source":"bank-data","data":{"kind":"lead","patterns":[{"id":"small-purchases","kind":"small-purchases","title":"53 purchases under €10 added up to €173 this year","detail":"Each one is small, about €3.26 on average, which is why they are easy to miss. Together they are 14% of your everyday spending.","yearlyImpactEur":172.58,"confidence":"high","billType":null,"evidence":{"from":"2025-10-01","to":"2026-09-30","basket":"everyday"},"facts":[{"id":"small:count","label":"Purchases under €10","value":53,"unit":"count","source":"bank-data","basis":"everyday-basket purchases in the last 12 months","evidence":{"from":"2025-10-01","to":"2026-09-30","basket":"everyday"}},{"id":"small:total","label":"Total of purchases under €10","value":172.58,"unit":"EUR/year","source":"bank-data","basis":"sum of those purchases","evidence":{"from":"2025-10-01","to":"2026-09-30","basket":"everyday"}}],"nextSteps":["get_spending","run_scenario"]},{"id":"bill-opportunity:utilities-1","kind":"bill-opportunity","title":"Electricity: €622 a year","detail":"Paid in 12 of the last 12 months, between €31 and €75; the amount moves, so it looks usage-based. Contracts like this are often cheaper for new customers than for loyal ones, so it is worth checking today's offers.","yearlyImpactEur":null,"confidence":"high","billType":"electricity","evidence":{"from":"2025-10-01","to":"2026-09-30","category":"Utilities"},"facts":[{"id":"utilities-1:monthly","label":"Electricity, average per month","value":51.87,"unit":"EUR/month","source":"bank-data","basis":"average of 12 payments in the last 12 months","evidence":{"from":"2025-10-01","to":"2026-09-30","category":"Utilities"}},{"id":"utilities-1:yearly","label":"Electricity, per year","value":622.44,"unit":"EUR/year","source":"calculation","basis":"monthly average times 12","evidence":{"from":"2025-10-01","to":"2026-09-30","category":"Utilities"}}],"nextSteps":["search_offers","explain_concept"]},{"id":"idle-cash","kind":"idle-cash","title":"Your balance covers 25.11 months of must-pay costs","detail":"A common rule of thumb is a buffer of three to six months. About €20672 sits above a six-month buffer in an account that, in this data, earns no interest. What to do with it is your decision; Sisu can show what different choices would look like.","yearlyImpactEur":null,"confidence":"medium","billType":null,"evidence":{"from":"2025-10-01","to":"2026-09-30"},"facts":[{"id":"idle:runway","label":"Months of must-pay costs covered by the balance","value":25.11,"unit":"months","source":"calculation","basis":"balance divided by average must-pay costs"},{"id":"idle:above-buffer","label":"Balance above a six-month buffer","value":20672.45,"unit":"EUR","source":"calculation","basis":"balance minus 6 months of must-pay costs"}],"nextSteps":["run_scenario","explain_concept"]},{"id":"bill-opportunity:utilities-2","kind":"bill-opportunity","title":"Home internet: €484 a year","detail":"Paid in 12 of the last 12 months, between €27 and €63; the amount moves, so it looks usage-based. Contracts like this are often cheaper for new customers than for loyal ones, so it is worth checking today's offers.","yearlyImpactEur":null,"confidence":"high","billType":"internet","evidence":{"from":"2025-10-01","to":"2026-09-30","category":"Utilities"},"facts":[{"id":"utilities-2:monthly","label":"Home internet, average per month","value":40.32,"unit":"EUR/month","source":"bank-data","basis":"average of 12 payments in the last 12 months","evidence":{"from":"2025-10-01","to":"2026-09-30","category":"Utilities"}},{"id":"utilities-2:yearly","label":"Home internet, per year","value":483.84,"unit":"EUR/year","source":"calculation","basis":"monthly average times 12","evidence":{"from":"2025-10-01","to":"2026-09-30","category":"Utilities"}}],"nextSteps":["search_offers","explain_concept"]},{"id":"bill-opportunity:utilities-3","